+# Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901)
+
+Added `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` in `src/index.ts`. It validates the pointer (empty, or
+starting with `/`; `~` only as `~0` / `~1`), decodes tokens, and walks the document. It throws on an
+invalid pointer or when the pointer does not resolve. Tests in `test/pointer.test.ts` cover the RFC's
+section 5 examples (characterization of the spec), escapes, strict array indices, own-property
+lookup and error paths; run with `npm test`.
+
+Decisions: see dl-001.
